.
.  Macro to generate geometric representation of contour
.  plot with line of steepest ascent
.
device 1 x11
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 300 300
.
y1label displacement 10
tic marks off
label size 3
tic label size 3
char size 3 3 3 3
xlimits -1 +1
ylimits -1 +1
major tic mark number 2
minor tic mark number 0
tic mark label format alpha
x1tic mark label content -1cr()1450  +1cr()1600
y1tic mark label content 70cr()-1  120cr()+1
ytic offset 0.1 0.7
xtic offset 0.1 1
tic offset units data
.
frame pattern blank
label case asis
x1label sp()cr()Oven Temperature
y1label Quench Temperature
.
read x y tag
-0.8 -0.8  1
0.8 -0.8   2
0.8  0.8   3
-0.8 0.8   4
1.5  1.3   5
end of data
character 64 77 88.5 55.5 X
line bl bl bl bl bl
.
plot y x tag
line solid
box shadow hw 0 0
box data -1 -1 1 1
.  drawdata 290 19 360 19 360 31 290 31 290 19
let function f = 2.8 - x2
let x2 = data 1.2 1.8
let y2 = f
pre-erase off
limits freeze
char blank
line dotted
plot y2 x2
.
device 2 close
system mv dppl1f.dat  2x2des7.jpeg
.
. quit
